nance burden of jBox.\nTherefore, the JboxTransfer project was founded. We aim to build an efficient, secure and convenient application to automate and help users to better migrate files from jBox to Pan. Users can migrate files with one click after jAccount authorization without taking up local disk space or manually downloading and uploading files.","name":"JboxTransfer","packageUrl":"https://pan.sjtu.edu.cn/jboxtransfer/","publisher":"SJTU","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/1357310795","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/1357310795/JboxTransfer/releases/tag/v2.0.4","tags":["jbox","pan","sjtu","prc","china"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"高效、安全、便捷地转移您的文件","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/1357310795/JboxTransfer/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.txt","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"在新一代交大云盘即将推出之际，由于与旧云盘（以下简称 jBox）存储策略有较大差异，文件转移较为困难，厂商无法给出理想的解决方案。若完全依赖于用户自行转移文件，对用户而言极为不便，且极大影响了新云盘的口碑，还可能增加旧云盘的维护时间。\n故 JboxTransfer 项目就此成立，我们的目标是推出一款高效、安全、便捷的应用程序，自动化地帮助用户更好地从 jBox 向 新云盘 迁移文件。用户在进行 jAccount 授权后可以一键迁移文件，无需占用本地磁盘空间，无需手动下载上传文件。","name":"JboxTransfer","packageUrl":"https://pan.sjtu.edu.cn/jboxtransfer/","publisher":"SJTU","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/1357310795","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/1357310795/JboxTransfer/releases/tag/v2.0.4","tags":["jbox","上海交大","上海交通大学","交大","交大云盘"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/1357310795","releaseDate":"2025-03-28","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/1357310795/JboxTransfer/releases/tag/v2.0.4","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/1/1357310795/JboxTransfer/2.0.4/1357310795.JboxTransfer.yaml","sha256":"6fa72b195fa7763a2951b4a70fbd0b82db273a4e4704eb63d8797225868e0dd3"},{"path":"manifests/1/1357310795/JboxTransfer/2.0.4/1357310795.JboxTransfer.installer.yaml","sha256":"bdbee233b2e445e38950ae6a8868dc8b08dc0f7a7dcab7566b136e59ed6d998f"},{"path":"manifests/1/1357310795/